// Conformance fixture for ta.rsi (S-bead OpenBBTechnical-0e9.5.20, Wave 5B-2).
//
// Author-derivative posture per PRD §7.3: reference output computed
// deterministically by running this script's RSI formula against a
// hard-coded synthetic close series (see ta_rsi.csv `close` column).
// No chart data is redistributed; the .csv is a pure function of this .pine.
//
// RSI(close, 3) warms up over 3 bars (Wilder smoothing on up/down channels):
// the first bar records only the previous-close seed, the next two build
// the rma buffers, and the value first appears at bar 3 (0-indexed).
//@version=6
indicator("smoke_ta_rsi", overlay=false)
plot(ta.rsi(close, 3), title="rsi3")
